<section class="section wrap career-narrative" id="career-narrative">
 <div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">3 / MY CAREER NARRATIVE</p><h2>How my experience connects to the work.</h2></div><p>The thread across my work is turning an unclear problem into a usable process with evidence, clear ownership and a concrete output.</p></div>
 <div class="career-work-map">
 <ol class="career-work-pipeline">{workConnections.map((item,i)=><li>
 <div class="career-work-node"><span class="career-work-step">0{i+1} / SAFETY SPA WORK</span><h4>{item.work}</h4><p>{item.task}</p><span class="career-work-output">{item.output}</span></div>
 <div class="career-evidence-link"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span><div class="career-transfer"><span>HOW THIS TRANSFERS</span><p>{item.transfer}</p></div></div>
 <div class="career-evidence-node"><span class="career-evidence-source">{item.source}</span><strong>{item.metric}</strong><p>{item.evidence}</p></div>
 </li>)}</ol>
 </div>
</section>
